flowchart TB
  A[AOI + monitoring run] --> S[Search STAC metadata]
  S --> C[Persist acquisitions / catalogue refresh]
  C --> P[Choose before and after observations]
  P --> Q{Credentials and rasterio available?}
  Q -- No --> X[Record blocked / failed run; no false analysis]
  Q -- Yes --> R[Request six-band GeoTIFF]
  R --> G[Align rasters, mask cloud/shadow, calculate NDVI]
  G --> M{Validated Siamese checkpoint?}
  M -- Yes --> ML[Siamese U-Net probability map]
  M -- No --> B[Spectral baseline probability map]
  ML --> T[Threshold, morphology, connected components]
  B --> T
  T --> F[Classify region, calculate area, save finding]
  F --> L[Create deduplicated alert when threshold is met]
